摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A small monorepo of plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — self-hosted, battle-tested against real incidents (crash-prevention discipline, idempotent installers, upgrade recovery).","id":"gh:1333774701","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugins","slug":"TZHR-invest/dsh-plugins","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A small monorepo of plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — self-hosted, battle-tested against real inc"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"idents (crash-prevention discipline, idempotent installers, upgrade recovery)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A small monorepo of plugins for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) — self-hosted, battle-tested against real i"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ncidents (crash-prevention discipline, idempotent installers, upgrade recovery)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Plugins"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Package | npm | What it does |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| dsh-lan-gateway | `dsh-lan-gateway` | **LAN / remote access gateway** for the Web UI: 0.0.0.0 bind"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ing, `crypto.randomUUID` polyfill, **token gate** (401 login page + WebSocket interception, loopback"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" exempt), privileged-fence + settings-persistence exemptions, idempotent installer + `reapply-lan-pa"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"tches.sh` recovery. Trusted networks only. |\n| dsh-vision-tool | `dsh-vision-tool` | Registers a `vi"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"sion` tool for agents: describe local images via **any OpenAI-compatible vision endpoint you configu"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"re** — no built-in keys, optional multi-model `cross_check` to guard against hallucinations. |\n| dsh"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"-mobile-ui | `dsh-mobile-ui` | Mobile UI for the Web GUI (≤768px): full-width responsive layout, ove"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"rlay session drawer, 44px touch targets, safe-area support, reading enhancements — zero desktop impa"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"session drawer, 44px touch targets, safe-area support, reading enhancements — zero desktop impact. |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"All three follow the official bundle contract (`dsh.bundle.patch`), pass the repo's contract preflig"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ht (classic-script bundles, no top-level import/export, `exports[\"./client\"]` present), and ship ide"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"mpotent installers with headless smoke tests and uninstall rollback."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Security**: dsh-lan-gateway binds the Web GUI to 0.0.0.0 — any device that can reach the port"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" can drive the agent. Trusted networks only; the token gate is authorization, not encryption."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Infrastructure in this repo"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- `scripts/preflight.mjs` — contract preflight for plugin packages (the crash-prevention checklist: "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"platform, exports, classic-script bundle, id consistency). Runs automatically in `build.sh`.\n- `scri"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"pts/new-plugin.sh` + `templates/` — scaffold new plugins from a template with an auto-generated idem"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"potent installer (preflight + headless smoke + idempotent wiring + uninstall rollback).\n- `docs/deve"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"lopment.md` — plugin development guide (host/client mechanism, package spec, wiring, debugging, §8 c"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"rash-prevention checklist).\n- `docs/publishing.md` — tarball distribution guide."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## External plugins (registered only, not copied)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **memory-recall-dsh** — long-term memory plugin (6 tools + auto recall injection + auto capture). "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"Code lives in the `memory_recall` repo (`apps/api/src/plugins/dsh/`); this repo only links it to avo"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"id source drift. Requires a self-deployed backend.\n- **dshmarket** — visual plugin market inside the"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" Web GUI (browse/search/install/update/uninstall 300+ community plugins, themes). Upstream: dsh-mark"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"et/dsh-market (npm `dshmarket`, MIT, zero runtime deps); registered here only, not copied. Install: "},{"id":"p14s6","text":"`dsh plugin --profile web add dshmarket`, then restart `dsh web`; entry at Settings → Plugin Market."},{"id":"p14s7","text":" Note: its in-UI one-click restart (loopback + same-origin guarded) is enabled by default — on hosts"},{"id":"p14s8","text":" without a supervisor, prefer a manual terminal restart or set `allowRestart: false`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"MIT. Chinese documentation: README.zh.md"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
